---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
import { site, prettyPhone } from '../data/site';
/* Interim refund policy (20 Nov 2026). TODO(owner): Tanishk to confirm the
   notice periods and the 50% refund below are what the business can honour,
   then have the page reviewed. Whatever is published here is what customers
   will hold us to. */
const updated = '20 November 2026';
---
<Base title="Cancellations & Refunds · YourSpace Jabalpur"
      description="How to reschedule or cancel a session at YourSpace Jabalpur, and how refunds work.">
  <PageHead crumb="Cancellations" beam={false}>
    <h1 class="headline">Plans <em>change</em>.</h1>
    <p class="standfirst">How to move a booking, how to cancel one, and what happens to anything you've paid.</p>
  </PageHead>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="shell narrow prose">
      <p class="fine" style="margin-top:0">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <h2>If you haven't paid yet</h2>
      <p>If you chose to pay after we call, there's nothing to cancel. Tell us, or just let us know when we ring, and you owe nothing.</p>

      <h2>Moving a paid booking</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>More than 48 hours before your slot:</strong> we'll move you to any free slot at no charge.</li>
        <li><strong>24 to 48 hours before:</strong> we'll move you once if a slot is free.</li>
        <li><strong>Less than 24 hours before:</strong> we'll try, but we can't promise, because the slot was held for you and turned away from others.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Ask as early as you can. The earlier you tell us, the more we can do.</p>

      <h2>Cancelling a paid booking</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>More than 48 hours before your slot:</strong> full refund of anything paid.</li>
        <li><strong>24 to 48 hours before:</strong> 50% refund.</li>
        <li><strong>Less than 24 hours before, or not turning up:</strong> no refund.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Where a decoration, cake, bouquet or celebration video has already been arranged for you, we may have to deduct what we've already spent on it. We'll tell you the amount and why.</p>

      <h2>If we cancel</h2>
      <p>If we have to cancel or move your session for any reason, or we can't give you the slot you paid for, you get the choice of the next available slot or a full refund of everything you've paid. No deductions.</p>

      <h2>Arriving late</h2>
      <p>Your session ends at its scheduled time regardless of when you arrive, because another booking may follow yours. If the room is free afterwards we'll do what we can. No refund is due for time you didn't use.</p>

      <h2>How refunds are paid</h2>
      <p>Refunds go back through Razorpay to the same card, UPI account or bank account you paid with. We start a refund within 2 working days of agreeing it with you. Razorpay and your bank usually take 5 to 7 working days after that for the money to reach your account.</p>

      <h2>Something went wrong on the night</h2>
      <p>Tell us while you're still there if you can. Most things we can fix on the spot. If we couldn't give you what you booked, say so and we'll put it right.</p>

      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
      <p>To move or cancel a booking, call <a href={`tel:${site.phone}`}>{prettyPhone}</a>, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or use our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. Please have your booking reference, or the date and the name the booking was made under.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
